      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is on 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If validation checks fail during the live patch, the rollback procedure is to run the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior rules and replays the invalidation hook. After rollback, the team must notify Verdant Bay, open an incident for manual remediation, and revert any partial replays. No further detailed rollback steps or scripts beyond this CLI command and these high-level post-rollback actions are provided in the evidence [art_fff67d92fe41].",
