      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the following are dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems: Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. These accounts report issues such as search relevance degradation after taxonomy changes, low-relevance or missing search results, and problems with taxonomy updates affecting incident lookup and playbook triggers [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026].\n\nThe following accounts are dealing with duplicate-action problems: Helix Assemblies Inc., LedgerBright Analytics, LedgerPeak Software, MedLogix Distribution, Peregrine Logistics Group, and Pioneer Grid Retail LLC. Their issues include workflow deduplication drift during cross-system handoffs, duplicate incidents, duplicated remediation runs, and idempotency key mismatches often linked to acquisitions or system consolidations [art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].\n\nThis classification covers all 12 North America West Event Nexus accounts, as the total matched and returned account count is 12 and all are accounted for in the evidence. However, no additional accounts beyond these 12 are mentioned or classified [ACCOUNT_LOOKUP_COVERAGE, art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].",
